{"_id":"6ac0e17c242cbc19f8924501","id":"vicharanashala-org/Online_Live_Polling_Dataset","author":"vicharanashala-org","sha":"fe7e2ce075ceeb2256da951e11f26355df06eb59","lastModified":"2026-10-03T11:19:52.000Z","private":false,"gated":false,"disabled":false,"tags":["language:en","license:mit","size_categories:100K<n<1M","region:us","Education","Engagement","Participation","Data Analytics"],"description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOnline Live-Polling Dataset\n\t\n\nLive poll records and attendance from 47 online sessions. The data was collected\nin an internship programme between May 2026 and July 2026. Sessions were held\nover Zoom, and the polls were run with Zoom's built-in polling feature, so all\ntables derive from Zoom's poll and attendance exports.\nSix tables. sessions.csv and polls.csv describe sessions and polls;\nthe other four record attendance and poll answers at the level of individual\nparticipants, who… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/vicharanashala-org/Online_Live_Polling_Dataset.","downloads":65,"likes":2,"cardData":{"license":"mit","language":["en"],"tags":["Education","Engagement","Participation","Data Analytics"],"pretty_name":"Online Live-Polling Dataset","size_categories":["100K<n<1M"]},"siblings":[{"rfilename":".gitattributes"},{"rfilename":"README.md"},{"rfilename":"attendance_intervals.csv"},{"rfilename":"attendance_timeline.csv"},{"rfilename":"participant_sessions.csv"},{"rfilename":"poll_responses.csv"},{"rfilename":"polls.csv"},{"rfilename":"sessions.csv"}],"createdAt":"2026-10-03T11:05:32.000Z","usedStorage":0}